Gemmified-OpenGM
================

A fork of OpenGM <https://github.com/misternebula/OpenGM> that builds the
GameMaker Studio runner for WebAssembly and packages it as a GEMS-protocol plugin.

It is based on upstream commit a23f7eea78173f46a5f70eb36c0bd0f11004c7b2
(2026-07-14). Upstream commits after that one are not included.

OpenGM is licensed MIT and so is this fork; see LICENSE. Copyright in the
original work is retained by the OpenGM authors and contributors.
Modifications in this fork are Copyright (c) 2026 Dapper Mink, under the same
MIT licence.

Third-party components
----------------------

UndertaleModTool <https://github.com/UnderminersTeam/UndertaleModTool>, by the
Underminers team and contributors, is included as a git submodule
(UndertaleModTool/) pointing at the fork
<https://github.com/QuentinJanuel/UndertaleModTool>, branch gemmified. It is
licensed GPL-3.0; see UndertaleModTool/LICENSE.txt. OpenGM and OpenGM.Wasm
build against its UndertaleModLib project.

Underanalyzer <https://github.com/UnderminersTeam/Underanalyzer> is a submodule
of UndertaleModTool, at the commit UndertaleModTool pins. It is licensed
MPL-2.0; see UndertaleModTool/Underanalyzer/LICENSE.

